---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
    title="Financial Tools — Less."
    description="Discover practical financial minimalism tools for budgeting and simple, low-cost investing."
    path="/money/tools"
    section="money"
>
        <section class="hero small">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1>Financial Tools</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">Spend less on what doesn't matter.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-shapes">
                <div class="shape shape-1"></div>
                <div class="shape shape-2"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
            <h2>Budgeting Tools</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">The first step to financial minimalism is knowing exactly where your money goes. These tools make that effortless.</p>
            <div class="cards">
                <a href="https://www.ynab.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>YNAB</h3>
                    <p>You Need A Budget. A zero-based budgeting app that gives every dollar a job. Proven to save users over $600 in their first two months.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://copilot.money/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Copilot</h3>
                    <p>A beautifully designed personal finance app that automatically categorizes your spending and gives you a clear picture of your financial life.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.monarchmoney.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Monarch Money</h3>
                    <p>A modern money management app that tracks spending, net worth, and goals — with collaborative features for households and couples.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
            <h2>Investing Simply</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">The minimal investor owns a few broad index funds and leaves them alone. These platforms make that easy.</p>
            <div class="cards">
                <a href="https://investor.vanguard.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Vanguard</h3>
                    <p>The pioneer of low-cost index fund investing. Owned by its investors, Vanguard's interests are aligned with yours — not Wall Street's.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.fidelity.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Fidelity</h3>
                    <p>Offers zero-expense-ratio index funds and one of the best platforms for simple, long-term investing. Trusted by millions of investors.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.betterment.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Betterment</h3>
                    <p>A robo-advisor that automates diversification and tax-loss harvesting. Set your goals, contribute regularly, and let it work.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section next-step">
            <h2>Tools Are Just the Start</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">The habits behind financial freedom matter more than any app. Build the practices that last.</p>
            <div class="next-step-links">
                <a href="/money/habits" class="cta-button">Build Daily Habits</a>
            </div>
        </section>
</Layout>
